{"id":"196cc15aecc1c1ef","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-generic-extension-step.md","title":"集合模型的单步泛型扩张","display":"df-generic-extension-step — 集合模型的单步泛型扩张","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-generic-extension-step","aliases":["58-df-generic-extension-step"],"display":"df-generic-extension-step — 集合模型的单步泛型扩张","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-generic-extension-step"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-generic-extension-step</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generic-extension-step — 集合模型的单步泛型扩张"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,P,R,G\\in V\">\\(M,N,P,R,G\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq P^2\">\\(R\\subseteq P^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pRq\">\\(pRq\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 比 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 强。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span> 为 ZFC 传递集合模型谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,R,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,R,M)\\)</span> 使用既有四元接口；名字与赋值使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 的实参顺序为地面模型、扩张模型。本定义不额外假设地面模型在环境宇宙中可数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}step}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S(M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists P,R,G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(P,R\\in M\\land P\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,R,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in N\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in M\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}step}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S(M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists P,R,G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(P,R\\in M\\land P\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,R,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in N\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in M\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>类模型的 generic multiverse 与这里的集合模型步骤分属不同类型。此处没有调用额外带可数性限制的 GenericExtension_S，因此不无意缩小原节点定义的模型范围。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,P,R,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq P^2","display":false},{"tex":"pRq","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,R,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}step}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S(M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists P,R,G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(P,R\\in M\\land P\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,R,M)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in N\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in M\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1533,"backlinks":[{"id":"87b6de91752d786a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GenericExtensionStep}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-generic-extension-step]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-582","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-generic-extension-step.md|58-df-generic-extension-step]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a9132c2c1a18acd1","545853811ce0a4b6","0c40d420e5118724"]}